+---
+
+## 13) Optional — Save_Image_URL + Sheets_Update_Image
+
+**After:** `Grok_Imagine`  
+**Before:** end
+
+### Save_Image_URL
+1. Add **Edit Fields**
+2. Name: `Save_Image_URL`
+3. Include Other Input Fields: ON
+
+| Name | Value |
+|---|---|
+| `image_url` | `={{ $json.data[0].url \|\| $json.url \|\| $json.data?.[0]?.url }}` |
